---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import marina from "../assets/images/marina.png";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="container">
    <div id="project-container">
      <section class="about">
        <h1>About</h1>

        <Image
          src={marina}
          alt="Portrait of Marina"
          class="about-photo"
        />

        <h1>About</h1>

        <p>I'm a Senior UX Writer at Turnitin, where I create technical documentation, software user guides, and help center content. I specialize in making complex software easier to understand and helping people solve problems independently.</p>

        <p>I started my career in public libraries, where I maintained websites and knowledge bases, documented troubleshooting procedures, and helped staff and patrons navigate unfamiliar technology. That experience shaped how I approach documentation: there's often a gap between how software is designed to work and how people actually experience it. I try to bridge that gap by anticipating where users might struggle and giving them the information they need to move forward.</p>

        <p>My documentation experience includes software configuration guides, complex user workflows, internal technical resources, and large-scale knowledge base projects. I've helped consolidate thousands of help articles, developed guidance for working with HTML-based content, and written instructions for both technical and nontechnical audiences.</p>

        <p>I especially enjoy hands-on documentation work that involves investigating software behavior, organizing complex information, and creating useful, reliable resources.</p>

        <p>Outside of work, I enjoy reading speculative fiction, playing video games, and exploring New Mexico.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>Based in Albuquerque, New Mexico.</p>

        <ul>
          <li><a href="mailto:marinamaffia.work@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marinarose92/">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pdfs/Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
  View my résumé (PDF)</a></li>
        </ul>

      </section>
    </div>
</div>
</Layout>